{
  "id": 281360125,
  "iid": 14367,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix checks for SocketCAN field availability.",
  "description": "For each field in the SocketCAN CAN XL pseudo-header, check if we have\nall of the field and, if so, swap it, rather than just checking for the\navailability of the complete header, just in case some packet is sliced\nin the middle of the header.\n\nDo this all with a bunch of offset/length #definitions, which also\nmeans we don't have to worry about alignment or structure layout.",
